<div class="welcome-row"><div><div class="form-kicker">CARTÕES E FATURAS</div><h1>Cartões de crédito</h1><p class="page-subtitle">Acompanhe limites, compras parceladas e faturas.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="/invoices">Ver faturas →</a></div>
<?php if($errors): ?><div class="alert error"><?=e(implode(' ',$errors))?></div><?php endif; ?>
<div class="credit-card-grid"><?php foreach($cards as $card): $percent=(int)$card['credit_limit']>0?min(100,(int)round((int)$card['used_limit']/(int)$card['credit_limit']*100)):0; ?><article class="credit-card-tile" style="--card-color:<?=e($card['color'])?>"><div class="credit-card-head"><span><?=e($card['institution']?:'CARTÃO')?></span><small><?=e($card['brand']?:' crédito')?></small></div><div class="credit-card-name"><?=e($card['name'])?></div><div class="credit-card-limit"><strong><?=money((int)$card['used_limit'])?></strong><span>de <?=money((int)$card['credit_limit'])?></span></div><div class="limit-track"><i style="width:<?=$percent?>%"></i></div><div class="credit-card-foot"><span>Fecha dia <?=e($card['closing_day'])?> · vence dia <?=e($card['due_day'])?></span><span><?=e($card['payment_account'])?></span></div><div class="credit-card-actions"><a href="/cards?edit=<?=(int)$card['id']?>#card-form">Editar</a><form method="post" action="/cards/toggle"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=(int)$card['id']?>"><button><?=$card['is_active']?'Desativar':'Ativar'?></button></form></div></article><?php endforeach; ?><?php if(!$cards): ?><div class="empty-account"><span class="empty-icon">▦</span><strong>Nenhum cartão cadastrado</strong><p>Cadastre seu cartão para acompanhar compras e faturas.</p></div><?php endif; ?></div>
<section class="panel editor-panel" id="card-form"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3><?=$edit?'Editar cartão':'Cadastrar cartão'?></h3><p>Informe os dados da fatura e a conta de pagamento.</p></div></div><?php if(!$accounts): ?><div class="inline-note">Cadastre uma conta antes de adicionar cartão. <a href="/accounts">Ir para contas</a></div><?php else: ?><form method="post" action="/cards/save" class="data-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=(int)($edit['id']??0)?>"><label>Nome do cartão<input name="name" required maxlength="80" value="<?=e($edit['name']??'')?>"></label><label>Instituição<input name="institution" maxlength="100" value="<?=e($edit['institution']??'')?>"></label><label>Bandeira<input name="brand" maxlength="40" value="<?=e($edit['brand']??'')?>" placeholder="Visa, Mastercard…"></label><label>Limite total<input name="credit_limit" inputmode="decimal" required value="<?=e(isset($edit['credit_limit'])?money_input((int)$edit['credit_limit']):'')?>" placeholder="0,00"></label><label>Dia de fechamento<input type="number" min="1" max="28" name="closing_day" required value="<?=e($edit['closing_day']??'10')?>"></label><label>Dia de vencimento<input type="number" min="1" max="28" name="due_day" required value="<?=e($edit['due_day']??'17')?>"></label><label>Conta para pagamento<select name="payment_account_id" required><?php foreach($accounts as $account): ?><option value="<?=(int)$account['id']?>" <?=($edit['payment_account_id']??'')==$account['id']?'selected':''?>><?=e($account['name'])?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><label>Cor<input type="color" name="color" value="<?=e($edit['color']??'#5478d4')?>"></label><div class="form-actions"><button class="button primary">Salvar cartão</button><?php if($edit): ?><a class="button secondary" href="/cards">Cancelar</a><?php endif; ?></div></form><?php endif; ?></section>
<section class="panel editor-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Registrar compra</h3><p>As parcelas são distribuídas nas faturas e somadas como despesas uma única vez.</p></div></div><?php if(!$cards||!$categories): ?><div class="inline-note">Para lançar compras, adicione um cartão ativo e uma categoria de despesa.</div><?php else: ?><form method="post" action="/cards/purchase" class="data-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><label>Cartão<select name="card_id"><?php foreach($cards as $card): if(!$card['is_active'])continue; ?><option value="<?=(int)$card['id']?>"><?=e($card['name'])?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><label>Descrição<input name="description" required maxlength="140"></label><label>Valor total<input name="total_amount" inputmode="decimal" required placeholder="0,00"></label><label>Data da compra<input type="date" name="purchase_date" required value="<?=date('Y-m-d')?>"></label><label>Parcelas<input type="number" name="installment_count" min="1" max="60" value="1" required></label><label>Categoria<select name="category_id"><?php foreach($categories as $category): ?><option value="<?=(int)$category['id']?>"><?=e($category['name'])?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><label class="span-two">Observações<input name="notes" maxlength="500"></label><div class="form-actions"><button class="button primary">Registrar compra</button></div></form><?php endif; ?></section>
<section class="panel statement-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Compras recentes</h3><p>Últimos 100 registros de cartão</p></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Data</th><th>Compra</th><th>Cartão</th><th>Categoria</th><th>Parcelas</th><th class="right">Total</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($purchases as $purchase): ?><tr><td><?=e(date('d/m/Y',strtotime($purchase['purchase_date'])))?></td><td><?=e($purchase['description'])?></td><td><?=e($purchase['card_name'])?></td><td><?=e($purchase['category_name']??'—')?></td><td><?=e($purchase['installment_count'])?>x</td><td class="right amount-out"><?=money((int)$purchase['total_amount'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?><?php if(!$purchases): ?><tr><td class="table-empty" colspan="6">Nenhuma compra registrada.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div></section>
